marché | market | Je vais au marché pour acheter des fruits. | shopping | 1 | I'm going to the market to buy some fruit.
ouvert | open | Le magasin est ouvert jusqu'à huit heures. | shopping | 1 | The shop is open until eight.
fermé | closed | Le musée est fermé le mardi. | shopping | 1 | The museum is closed on Tuesdays.
acheter | to buy | Je vais acheter un nouveau manteau. | shopping | 1 | I'm going to buy a new coat.
vendre | to sell | Mon voisin veut vendre sa voiture. | shopping | 2 | My neighbour wants to sell his car.
payer | to pay | Je vais payer avec ma carte bancaire. | shopping | 2 | I'm going to pay with my bank card.
argent | money | Mon argent est dans mon sac. | shopping | 2 | My money is in my bag.
cadeau | present; gift | J'ai un cadeau pour ma mère. | shopping | 1 | I have a present for my mother.

# A1.9 Wants and likes — arts
chanter | to sing | J'aime chanter sous la douche. | arts | 1 | I like singing in the shower.
chanson | song | C'est ma chanson préférée ! | arts | 1 | It's my favourite song!
dessiner | to draw | J'aime dessiner des animaux. | arts | 1 | I like drawing animals.
théâtre | theatre; drama | Je fais du théâtre le mercredi. | arts | 2 | I do drama on Wednesdays.
artiste | artist | Mon oncle est artiste. | arts | 2 | My uncle is an artist.
beau | beautiful; handsome; lovely | Ce paysage est vraiment beau. | arts | 2 | This scenery is really beautiful.

# A1.10 Your day — daily routines
dormir | to sleep | J'aime dormir tard le dimanche. | daily_routines | 1 | I like sleeping late on Sundays.
d'abord | first; first of all | D'abord, je me lave les mains. | daily_routines | 2 | First, I wash my hands.
ensuite | then; next | Ensuite, je prends le petit déjeuner. | daily_routines | 2 | Then I have breakfast.
douche | shower | Je prends une douche le matin. | daily_routines | 1 | I have a shower in the morning.
brosse à dents | toothbrush | Où est ma brosse à dents ? | daily_routines | 2 | Where's my toothbrush?
rentrer | to go home; to come back | Je dois rentrer à la maison à six heures. | daily_routines | 2 | I have to go home at six.
ranger | to tidy; to put away | Je dois ranger ma chambre. | daily_routines | 2 | I have to tidy my room.
parler | to speak; to talk | J'aime parler français avec ma grand-mère. | daily_routines | 1 | I like speaking French with my grandmother.
apporter | to bring | Tu peux apporter un gâteau samedi ? | daily_routines | 2 | Can you bring a cake on Saturday?
prêter | to lend | Tu peux prêter ton vélo à Hugo ? | daily_routines | 2 | Can you lend your bike to Hugo?
fermer | to close; to shut | Tu peux fermer la porte, s'il te plaît ? | daily_routines | 1 | Can you close the door, please?

# A1.10 Your day — weather
temps | weather; time | Il fait quel temps à Paris ? | weather | 1 | What's the weather like in Paris?
soleil | sun | Il fait beau, il y a du soleil. | weather | 1 | The weather's nice; it's sunny.
ciel | sky | Le ciel est bleu aujourd'hui. | weather | 1 | The sky is blue today.
nuage | cloud | Il y a un gros nuage noir. | weather | 1 | There's a big black cloud.
pluie | rain | Je n'aime pas la pluie. | weather | 1 | I don't like the rain.
pleuvoir | to rain | Il va pleuvoir demain. | weather | 1 | It's going to rain tomorrow.
parapluie | umbrella | Je prends mon parapluie quand il pleut. | weather | 1 | I take my umbrella when it rains.
neige | snow | Les enfants jouent dans la neige. | weather | 1 | The children are playing in the snow.
vent | wind | Il y a du vent à la plage. | weather | 1 | It's windy at the beach.
printemps | spring | Au printemps, les jardins sont magnifiques. | weather | 1 | In spring the gardens are beautiful.
été | summer | En été, il fait très chaud ici. | weather | 1 | In summer it's very hot here.
automne | autumn; fall | En automne, les feuilles tombent. | weather | 1 | In autumn the leaves fall.
hiver | winter | En hiver, nous allons à la montagne. | weather | 1 | In winter we go to the mountains.

# A1.10 Your day — nature
mer | sea | Nous allons à la mer en été. | nature | 1 | We go to the seaside in summer.
montagne | mountain | Cette montagne est très haute. | nature | 1 | This mountain is very high.
campagne | countryside | Mes grands-parents habitent à la campagne. | nature | 1 | My grandparents live in the countryside.
forêt | forest; woods | La forêt est très belle en automne. | nature | 1 | The forest is very beautiful in autumn.
lac | lake | Il y a un lac près de mon village. | nature | 1 | There's a lake near my village.
rivière | river | Les enfants nagent dans la rivière. | nature | 1 | The children are swimming in the river.
fleuve | (large) river | Le fleuve traverse la ville. | nature | 3 | The river runs through the city.
île | island | La Corse est une belle île. | nature | 2 | Corsica is a beautiful island.
arbre | tree | Il y a un grand arbre devant la maison. | nature | 1 | There's a big tree in front of the house.
fleur | flower | Je donne une fleur à ma mère. | nature | 1 | I'm giving my mother a flower.

# A1.10 Your day — clothing
porter | to wear; to carry | Je n'aime pas porter de chapeau. | clothing | 1 | I don't like wearing a hat.
