pull | jumper; sweater | Il fait froid, je mets un pull. | clothing | 1 | It's cold, so I'm putting on a jumper.
pantalon | trousers; pants | Ce pantalon est trop petit. | clothing | 1 | These trousers are too small.
jean | jeans | Mon jean est trop grand. | clothing | 1 | My jeans are too big.
robe | dress | Elle porte une robe rouge. | clothing | 1 | She's wearing a red dress.
jupe | skirt | Elle porte une jupe longue. | clothing | 1 | She's wearing a long skirt.
chemise | shirt | Mon père porte une chemise blanche. | clothing | 1 | My father is wearing a white shirt.
chaussure | shoe | Ma chaussure est sous le lit. | clothing | 1 | My shoe is under the bed.
